# The corpus is fetched, not committed — NOTICE.md says why, and every run
# records the file's BLAKE3 so a published score still identifies the bytes
# it was computed from (EVAL-3, ADR-0061 decision 11).
longmemeval_*.json

# Upstream's own licence file arrives with the data and is ignored for the
# same reason the data is. `scripts/check-corpus-licences.mjs` asserts it is
# present whenever the corpus is; NOTICE.md is the committed record.
LICENSE
LICENSE.*
